    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n29248" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δυσ-μήχᾰνος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>hard to effect</i>,
			Epimen. ap. <i><span class="en">
				D.L.
				1.113
			</span></i>; <i>difficult</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀρχύτεω
				δυσμήχανα ἔργα κυλι&lt;&gt;νδρων</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Eratosth.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				35.7
			</span></i>; prob. 
				f.l. for
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δύσμαχον</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>BJ</u>
				4.1.2
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Act.
			, <i>at a loss</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρός τι</span>”
