					Them.
					<u>Or.</u>
					10.137b
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>devising ill</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Nonn.
				<u>D.</u>
