				35.273
			</span></i>; also, <i>ill-devised, wicked</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔργον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Opp.
					<u>H.</u>
					3.404
				</span></i>
			.</div>
